{"orgCode":"2100","name":"Department of Alcoholic Beverage Control","agencyCode":"1000","agencyName":"Business and Consumer Services","description":"The Department of Alcoholic Beverage Control is vested with the exclusive power to license and regulate persons and businesses engaged in the manufacture, importation, distribution, and sale of alcoholic beverages in the State of California. The Department's mission is to provide the highest level of equitable service and public safety to the people of the state through licensing, education, and enforcement.","website":"https://www.abc.ca.gov","totals":{"amounts":{"py":102081,"cy":108194,"by":108786},"positions":{"py":503.9,"cy":541.9,"by":540.9},"excluded":{"reimbursement":{"py":3902,"cy":5147,"by":5147}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/1000/2100","kind":"department","name":"Department of Alcoholic Beverage Control","code":"2100","amounts":{"py":102081,"cy":108194,"by":108786},"positions":{"py":503.9,"cy":541.9,"by":540.9},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":102081,"cy":108194,"by":108786}},"children":[{"id":"exp/1000/2100/1640","kind":"program","name":"Administration of the Alcoholic Beverage Control Act","code":"1640","amounts":{"py":102081,"cy":108194,"by":108786},"byFundType":{"special":{"py":102081,"cy":108194,"by":108786}},"positions":{"py":503.9,"cy":541.9,"by":540.9},"description":"1640 - ADMINISTRATION OF THE ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGE CONTROL ACT\n\nThis program conducts three major activities:\n\n• Licensing, which ensures that only qualified persons and legitimate businesses are licensed to sell, manufacture, or otherwise deal in alcoholic beverages.\n\n• Compliance, which ensures adherence to the alcoholic beverage control laws and regulations by all persons operating within the alcoholic beverage industry.\n\n• Administration, which provides staff support and conducts administrative hearings.","extra":{"byAppropriationType":{"State Operations":{"py":103045,"cy":110341,"by":110933},"Local Assistance":{"py":2938,"cy":3000,"by":30